  <p id="c-nanshi-023-wangtong-gongda:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-023-wangtong-gongda:p001:m0000" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAC">通</persName>字<persName id="c-nanshi-023-wangtong-gongda:p001:m0002" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAC">公達</persName>，仕梁為黃門侍郎。敬帝承制，以為尚書右僕射。陳武帝受禪，遷左僕射。太建元年，為左光祿大夫。六年，加特進，侍中、將軍、光祿、佐史、扶並如故。未拜，卒，諡曰成。弟<persName id="c-nanshi-023-wangtong-gongda:p001:m0083" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAG">勱</persName>。</p>
</text>
